1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
VEIL ATLAS - The invisible map of how a place truly feels. Accept privacy terms to begin.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Featuring five location-gated layers: Now, Feel, Truth, Memory, and Rhythm.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:45,000
⚡ NOW: Live, local proximity signals within 500m that expire automatically in 30 minutes.

4
00:00:45,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Type your signal anonymously. It drops on the map as a live pulsing indicator.

5
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:15,000
🌡 FEEL: Share confessions or log emotional weather to record a location's sentiment.

6
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:30,000
When zoomed out, multiple overlapping feelings cluster into glowing 3D holographic towers.

7
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Click the 3D building cluster to preview secrets and confessions logged inside.

8
00:01:45,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Click "Zoom In" in the popup header to break the building apart into individual pins.

9
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:15,000
👁 TRUTH: Document safety or urban exclusion incidents with time-of-day categories.

10
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:25,000
Submit incidents anonymously to build a hyperlocal, community-sourced truth map.

11
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:40,000
🕰 MEMORY: Anchor memories to coordinates forever, including proximity-locked Echoes.

12
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:50,000
〜 RHYTHM: Interactive check-in density heat-grids, calculated in local timezone.

13
00:02:50,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Sleek glassmorphic Nominatim search geocoder and instant dark/light mode toggling.

14
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:13,000
Built with Next.js 16, Vercel Edge APIs, and AWS Aurora PostgreSQL via secure IAM OIDC auth.
